PURPOSE of /kernel/hotplug/memsofthotplug
Description: Test for memory online/offline hotplug
Author: William Gomeringer <wgomerin@redhat.com>

Description:

This test tries to test Memory soft hotplug

a) Basic: Tries offline and online each memory module.

b) Continous: This test tries to offline or online random memory
              modules for ~10 min (see CONTIME variable) while ebizzy
              produces 50% load on the total memory in the system. (This section is not complete)

PASS on no kernel panic or kernel oops or no failue to offline/online memory
